# Keep every text file LF on every platform. The kit's manifest and a module's
# lock hash the files, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true must not
# turn them into CRLF; in a module that merged the design system as a subtree
# this file applies to the subtree too.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.woff2 binary
*.webp binary
*.png binary
